        <div type="translation" resp="part:argr part:masc">
        <p>This is the blessing of our god(s). If the teachers mate, let them experience (the consequences of) evil/sin as heavy as heaven and earth combined. In the Śaka year 1380</p>
         </div>
         <div type="commentary"><p>The text is engraved inside a square cartouche.</p>
         </div>
